# Dockerfile-specific ignore file for the ASR v2 evaluation image.
#
# The build context is the repository root, which contains several GB of local
# data (audio archives, extracted segments, reference archives and local
# environments) that this image does not need. Excluding them keeps the
# context tiny so BuildKit does not have to hash and send them on every build.
#
# This file only affects builds that use this Dockerfile (via `-f`); the build
# command itself is unchanged and other benchmarks are unaffected.
#
# Patterns are relative to the root of the build context; the "**/" prefix
# makes them match at any depth.

# Local data / artifacts (not needed to run the evaluation)
**/bahraloutur
**/bahreloutur
**/nahreloutur
**/segments
**/segmentsproper

# Local tooling, caches and VCS metadata
**/.pixi
**/__pycache__
**/.vscode
**/.git
